stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT: create, import, or copy from a retired version
  DRAFT --> DRAFT: edit (lock version), validate, simulate
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL: request-publish (zero validation errors)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT: reject
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> PUBLISHED: approve by a different identity
  PUBLISHED --> RETIRED: newer version becomes effective, or retire
  PUBLISHED --> [*]
  RETIRED --> [*]
  note right of RETIRED
    Immutable. Still readable for
    explain and replay of old decisions.
  end note
